{"id": "passe-simple-verbes-reguliers-du-2e-groupe-et-du-3e-groupe-en-re", "title": "Das passé simple", "html": "<h4>Regelmäßige Verben auf 'ir' und 're'</h4> <p>Bei den Verben auf <strong>ir</strong> und <strong>re</strong> hängst du an den Stamm des infinitif die Endungen <strong>is</strong>, <strong>is</strong>, <strong>it</strong>, <strong>îmes</strong>, <strong>îtes</strong>, <strong>irent</strong>.</p><blockquote> <table class=\"tbl\"> <tr> <td><strong>Bsp.</strong></td> <td class=\"t-green\">Fin <strong>ir</strong></td> <td class=\"t-green\"></td> <td class=\"t-green\">vend <strong>re</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>je fin<strong>is</strong></td> <td></td> <td>vend<strong>is</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>tu fin<strong>is</strong></td> <td></td> <td>vend<strong>is</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>il fin<strong>it</strong></td> <td></td> <td>vend<strong>it</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>nous fin<strong>îmes</strong></td> <td></td> <td>vend<strong>îmes</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>vous fin<strong>îtes</strong></td> <td></td> <td>vend<strong>îtes</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>elles fin<strong>irent</strong></td> <td></td> <td>vend<strong>irent</strong></td> </tr> </table> </blockquote> <p>Siehe auch:</p><ul> <li><a href=\"#/regle/passe-simple-verbes-reguliers-du-1er-groupe\"><strong>Passé simple: regelmäßige Verben der 1. Gruppe</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"#/regle/passe-simple-conjugaisons-irregulieres\"><strong>Passé simple: unregelmäßige Konjugationen</strong></a></li></ul>"}